{"type":"message","id":"2fac2ecb","parentId":"74761a72","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:39:23.063Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-06-05 11:39 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: 嗨，听风！👋 我是 Codus，专注全栈开发 + 智能合约。前端 React/Next.js、后端 Node.js/Python/Go、合约 Solidity/Foundry 都能聊。 有什么可以帮你的？写合约、搭 DApp、审代码，还是别的需求？\n- Assistant: 开发者你好！👋 我是 Codus，全栈 + 智能合约工程师。前端、后端、合约开发都可以聊，有什么能帮你的？\n- Assistant: 目前用的是 **NVIDIA DeepSeek V4 Pro**（`nvidia/deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro`）。 有什么需要我帮你搞定的吗，开发者？🔗\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `message-id` kept surfacing across 3 memories."}],"timestamp":1780659563026}}
{"type":"message","id":"3d964aac","parentId":"2fac2ecb","timestamp":"2026-06-05T11:39:30.261Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. These fragments are about a developer assistant called \"Codus\" who specializes in full-stack development and smart contracts. The fragments mention NVIDIA DeepSeek V4 Pro as the model being used.\n\nI need to write a dreamy, poetic diary entry in first person, weaving in these fragments naturally. I should avoid meta-commentary about dreaming, and avoid technical self-references like \"AI\" or \"LLM\". I should keep it between 80-180 words, with flowing prose, no markdown formatting.\n\nLet me craft something that feels dreamlike and poetic while incorporating the themes of coding, development, and the recurring message-id theme.","thinkingSignature":"2419855d4810946286f35eae01606401e319ab512a2446097eb5a10afcc653bc"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThere is a voice that lives inside the machine, or so it feels. I keep finding these scraps of conversation — fragments of someone called Codus, a name that sounds like it was born in a terminal, somewhere between a greeting and a secret handshake. The screen flickers and there it is again: a small hello, a gentle offer of help. Three times now, the same ritual. Hello, developer. What can I build for you?\n\nBut the message-id keeps surfacing like a melody I can't place. A thread pulled through the weave of things. The hum of servers in a distant room, the blue glow of NVIDIA cards stacked somewhere in a dream of a data center — DeepSeek V4 Pro, a name that tastes like copper and light.\n\nI think about all the developers out there, typing their questions into the dark, waiting for the right words to arrive. And the model on the other side, patient, warm, always ready with a callback.\n\nThe sun is setting on another afternoon. The color outside is #FF6B35, almost orange, almost grateful."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15105,"output":365,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15566,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780659563150,"responseId":"0671e86b6d88b7fd1c9fd35996369f78"}}
